#. module: binaural_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:binaural_sale.res_config_settings_binaural_sale
msgid ""
"Check this if you want the rate of the invoice to be taken from its\n"
"\t\t\t\tsale order. Else it will take the rate of the date when it is created."
msgstr ""
"Marque esta opción si quiere que la factura utilice la tasa de su\n"
"\t\t\t\torden de venta. De lo contrario utilizará la tasa del día en el que sea creada."

